# Project Conventions

This repo is a Homebrew tap for `aws-sso-login`. It has two parts:
- `Formula/aws-sso-login.rb` — the Homebrew formula (auto-generated)
- `src/main.go` — Go script that auto-updates the formula from the latest GitHub release

## Hard Rules

- **Never manually edit `Formula/aws-sso-login.rb`.** It is fully regenerated by `src/main.go`.
- Go version is **1.23.4**; do not upgrade without updating `go.mod` and the CI workflow.
- No external Go dependencies — use stdlib only.
- All CI changes must target the `main` branch.

## Commit Style

Use imperative, lowercase prefixes:
- `feat:` new capability
- `fix:` bug fix
- `chore:` maintenance (dependency bumps, CI tweaks)
- `docs:` documentation only

Dependabot commits are prefixed with `[dependabot]` — do not reformat them.

## Makefile

Use `make` targets rather than raw `go` commands:
- `make run` — update the formula
- `make tests` — run tests
- `make build` — build the binary
